# 21-lod: level of detail. gbaLod is 0 normally, 1 after a play frame that took over ~27 ms, 2 over ~33 ms (it falls back
# a few frames after the last busy one, so nothing flickers). Only cosmetic drawing is reduced: half the weather
# particles, no cloud banks / far giant / neon billboard text; at 2 also no plants. State, collision, enemies, shots,
# the lander and the HUD are never touched (the particles are still moved, the plants are only not drawn).

